WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.103
"My bird stamp is lost forever!"

2
00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:14.318
cried Bird. Kip felt terrible. "I think I'll send

3
00:00:14.318 --> 00:00:18.754
a note to Bird," he

4
00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:24.669
thought. Kip went up to

5
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.531
his hole. He found a pencil

6
00:00:28.532 --> 00:00:32.778
and some paper. "Dear Bird," he wrote. "I'm

7
00:00:32.779 --> 00:00:34.636
sorry your bird stamp

8
00:00:34.637 --> 00:00:45.122
is lost forever. Your friend, Kip." Kip

9
00:00:45.123 --> 00:00:51.811
put the note into an

10
